sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Orcid as Orcid OAuth
    participant Scopus as Scopus Search API

    User->>+Frontend: Apply for researcher account
    Frontend->>-User: Ask what platform to use for verification
    alt Authorize with OrchidID
        %%Orcid way
        User->>+Frontend: Chooose OrcidID
        Frontend->>+Orcid: ASk for login page
        deactivate Frontend
        

        Orcid->>User: Send Orcid login page
        User->>Orcid: Enters Orcid credentials and consents
        Orcid->>+Frontend: Redirects and sends AUTH TOKEN
        deactivate Orcid
        Frontend->>+Backend: Sends AUTH TOKEN
        deactivate Frontend
        Backend->>+Orcid: Asks for access tokens
        Orcid->>-Backend: Access tokens
        Backend->>+Orcid: Ask for OrcidID
        Orcid->>-Backend: User's OrcidID
        Backend->>Backend: Save OrcidID of User

        deactivate Backend

    else Authorize with Google Scholar
        %%Google scollar way
        User->>+Frontend: Chooose Google Scholar
        Frontend->>User: Ask whether to use account email or enter other

        alt Choose account email
            User->>Frontend: Choose account email
        else Choose other email
            User->>Frontend: Choose other email and enter it
        end
        Frontend->>+Backend: Verify email
        deactivate Frontend
        Backend->>User: Send verification link
        User->>+Frontend: Go to verification link
        Frontend->>Backend: Confirm email ownership
        deactivate Frontend
        Backend->>Backend: Save Google Scholar of User

        deactivate Backend
        
    end

    %%Scopus stuff
        


    alt Authorized with OrcidID
        activate Backend
        Backend->>+Scopus: Serch for Scopus ID with this OrcidID
    else Authorized with Google Scholar
        Backend->>Scopus: Serch for Scopus ID with this Email
    end

    alt Scopus ID exist
        Scopus->>-Backend: Returns ScopusID
        Backend->>Backend: Save Scopus ID fo User
    else Scpus ID doesn't exist
        Scopus->>Backend: Return "No results found"
    end

    Backend->>+Frontend: Finish verifying
    deactivate Backend
    Frontend->>User: Show authorization finished
    
    
    

    
    
    




